<title>UK: Dresdner ups 2001 bond to 300 mln Swiss francs.</title>
<headline>Dresdner ups 2001 bond to 300 mln Swiss francs.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond has been increased, joint lead managers Dresdner Bank and SBC Warburg said.</p>
<p> BORROWER   DRESDNER FINANCE BV</p>
<p> GUARANTOR  DRESDNER BANK AG</p>
<p> AMT ** 300 MLN SFR   COUPON     2.25	MATURITY    26.JUN.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  98.35     PAY DATE    12.DEC.96</p>
<p> NOTES  **  ORIGINALLY LAUNCHED FOR 200 MLN SFR</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    EBS	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AA1	 DENOMS (K) 5	   SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> NOTES	PLUS 166 DAYS ACCRUED INTEREST</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
